  and written in hex.  Checked: dpc's section LIBDSC for this file is
  the image's 5004 bytes.  std_lib_rtns' initial pointers are not written: the
  prelude (globals_from_backend.ins.pas) declares the section without
  them, and the original's one variable per routine, if that is what
  it had, would be declared here; see docs/questions.md 140.

